{\fontsize{34}{40}\selectfont\bfseries\color{ChapterDusk}\kaiti\selectfont 日光之下}\\[0.10cm]
{\fontsize{16}{20}\selectfont\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} Under the Sun}

\vspace{0.20cm}
{\fontsize{22}{26}\selectfont\bfseries\kaiti\selectfont 傳道書研讀}\\[0.08cm]
{\fontsize{13}{16}\selectfont\itshape\color{TextGray} A Study of the Book of Ecclesiastes}

\vspace{0.24cm}
% One Hebrew word only: XeTeX lays out a maqaf- or space-joined Hebrew phrase as
% separate RTL runs in LTR order (word order and maqaf come out scrambled).
{\fontsize{15}{18}\selectfont\itshape\color{ChapterDusk} הֶבֶל }\quad
{\footnotesize\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} “hebel”}\quad
{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{SunOchre!80!black} 氣息 \textperiodcentered\ 全書三十八次（傳 1:2; 12:8）}

\vfill

\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.3in}
\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{SunOchre!70!black}\kaiti\selectfont
「傳道者說：虛空的虛空，虛空的虛空，凡事都是虛空。」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{TextGray}
“Vanity of vanities,” says the Preacher, “Vanity of vanities! All is vanity.”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{ChapterDusk} 傳道書 1:2 \textperiodcentered\ Ecclesiastes 1:2}
\vspace{0.15cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE - "全書一句話" built on Ecclesiastes 12:13, the conclusion the
%% whole book is argued toward.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterDusk} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
這些事都已聽見了，總意就是：\textbf{\color{BreathRose!80!black}敬畏神}，謹守他的誡命，這是人所當盡的本分。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
The conclusion, when all has been heard, \textup{is}: \textbf{fear God} and keep His commandments,
because this \textup{applies to} every person.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterDusk} 傳道書 12:13 \textperiodcentered\ Ecclesiastes 12:13
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 十二章經文 \textperiodcentered\ 十二篇研讀 \textperiodcentered\ 四卷 \textperiodcentered\ 「日光之下」說了二十九次，全在 10:5 之前\\
\textit{Twelve chapters of Ecclesiastes in twelve studies \textperiodcentered\ four volumes \textperiodcentered\ “under the sun” is said 29 times, all before 10:6}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.0cm}p{2.0cm}p{8.1cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷} & \textbf{研讀篇} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
卷一：試 & 1-2篇 & 神第一次出場是一份差事，第二次是一隻手 \\
卷二：時 & 3-6篇 & 神定了時候，又把永遠放在人心裏，人看不全 \\
卷三：問 & 7-10篇 & 智慧的極限：義人遭難，惡人享壽，人查不出 \\
卷四：歸 & 11-12篇 & 神必審問；一個牧者；敬畏 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterDusk} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一部悲觀的哲學，是來聽一個把日光之下試到盡頭的人怎樣說話。\\
前十章他不斷說「我見」；結尾轉向命令句，轉向造你的主，和一個牧者。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
Not a pessimist's philosophy, but the voice of one who tried everything under the sun
to its end. “I saw” fills the first ten chapters; the book closes in commands,
toward the Creator and one Shepherd.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
